▶ 5. Consulta direta a cada shard: cada conta só existe no nó da sua região
  pg-europa:
  $ psql "host=pg-europa.global.local,pg-europa-replica.global.local target_session_attrs=read-write dbname=bank" -c "SELECT iban, currency, balance FROM accounts WHERE user_id IN ('b0aba4e1-5fb7-44ab-801a-c33fc01a2eeb','e0531b30-70f0-4fe2-af7d-0d3d5678ed8e')"
          iban      | currency | balance 
    ----------------+----------+---------
     GS-EU-00000136 | EUR      |    0.00
    (1 row)
    
  pg-america:
  $ psql "host=pg-america.global.local,pg-america-replica.global.local target_session_attrs=read-write dbname=bank" -c "SELECT iban, currency, balance FROM accounts WHERE user_id IN ('b0aba4e1-5fb7-44ab-801a-c33fc01a2eeb','e0531b30-70f0-4fe2-af7d-0d3d5678ed8e')"
          iban      | currency | balance 
    ----------------+----------+---------
     GS-AM-00000079 | USD      |    0.00
    (1 row)
    
  ✔ GS-EU-00000136 só no pg-europa, GS-AM-00000079 só no pg-america
  a réplica também a tem (replicação streaming):
  $ psql "host=pg-europa-replica.global.local dbname=bank" -c "SELECT iban, pg_is_in_recovery() AS replica FROM accounts WHERE iban = 'GS-EU-00000136'"
          iban      | replica 
    ----------------+---------
     GS-EU-00000136 | t
    (1 row)
    

